<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Hallelujah, Lord,</l><l>We glority Your name;</l><l>Truly great and so wonderful Your works!</l><l>(Great and wonderful!)</l><l>Lord God Almighty,</l><l>Of the nations King,</l><l>Surely righteous and true are Your ways!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
